      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Minor, escalating memory loss the player can ad-lib in small ways, but which the Storyteller should periodically make dramatically significant (forgetting how to use a familiar Ability for a scene). Requires Storyteller buy-in before play, since overuse can wreck other players' trust in the character's reliability.</p><p><em>Source: Clanbook: Malkavian, New Derangements.</em></p>",
